This requirement is for the cleaning, inspection, and repair of the Mud Mountain Dam Sewage Lagoon.&nbsp; 

A site visit will be offered on 17 November 2026, see attachment for information and registration.&nbsp; 

Please pay attention to: Section L, Section M, and FAR 52.228-13 in the solicitation.&nbsp; 



